;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=512, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=29, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=600, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=541, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ストラップ黄.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Hmm... Where did I get something like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I only started carrying a phone in middle school, and I'd definitely remember anything from back then...<PG>
So it has to be from when I was even younger, but then a phone strap is a weird choice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And since it's yellow, someone must have picked it out for me.<PG>
To slip into the gaps in this genius girl's memory... Well, well, how formidable.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's just a strap, but a strap all the same. There must be some deep story behind it―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Huh? This is...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\アイテム\お友達の絵.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This is another old drawing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yeah, I remember this one. I drew it back in nursery school, in my last year there, I think.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I drew it as a picture of a friend, but...<PG>
Who's that with me? If it's a friend, maybe someone my age?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But did I even have any friends my age back then?<PG>
A grown-up breathing fire means they ate something spicy?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And we're happy about it...?<PG>
Yeah, I vaguely remember.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At a table I was passing, a parent and child were eating.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm pretty sure it was Zahha.<PG>
Argh, I can't remember anything past that...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's probably been 10 years or so since I last looked at this drawing, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmmm, maybe my closet has more buried treasure than I thought.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE>, are you still here? Your train leaves soon, doesn't it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah! Oh no! This is really, really bad! I'm going to be late!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------